| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/size.expression.grammer.ts` | Seven expression types, path types and constant-size guard |
| `src/storage.size.expression.canonicalise.ts` | Pure simplification |
| `src/storage.size.expression.evaluate.ts` | Runtime evaluator and controller-path resolution |
| `src/storage.size.expression.canonicalise.spec.ts` | Canonicalisation and equivalence tests |
| `src/storage.size.expression.evaluator.spec.ts` | Evaluation, nested repetition, alignment and path tests |
| `index.ts` | Public exports |

The present tests exercise the algebra; meaningful end-to-end acceptance additionally needs **published copybooks and known byte records**, checking independent physical field offsets, not only agreement between the compiler and evaluator.
